(A SHORT GUIDE TO THE SOLAR SYSTEM) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The solar system is the Sun and everything bound to it by gravity: eight) Tj
T*
(planets, their moons, dwarf planets, asteroids, and comets. This guide) Tj
T*
(gives you one friendly page on each of the more famous members.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(THE SUN) Tj
T*
(The Sun is a star at the center of the solar system. It is a huge ball of) Tj
T*
(hot plasma, and its gravity holds every planet in orbit. It provides the) Tj
T*
(light and heat that make life on Earth possible.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
