(MARS -- THE RED PLANET) Tj
T*
(Mars is the fourth planet from the Sun. It looks red because its soil is) Tj
T*
(rich in iron oxide, which is basically rust. Mars has two tiny moons,) Tj
T*
(Phobos and Deimos, and the tallest volcano in the solar system, Olympus) Tj
T*
(Mons. A day on Mars is about 24 hours and 39 minutes, close to Earth's.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
