(JUPITER -- THE GIANT) Tj
T*
(Jupiter is the largest planet in the solar system, so big that all the) Tj
T*
(other planets could fit inside it. Its most famous feature is the Great) Tj
T*
(Red Spot, a storm wider than Earth that has raged for centuries. Jupiter) Tj
T*
(has 95 confirmed moons, including Ganymede, the largest moon in the) Tj
T*
(solar system.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
