(SATURN -- THE RINGED PLANET) Tj
T*
(Saturn is best known for its bright rings, which are made of countless) Tj
T*
(chunks of ice and rock. It is the second-largest planet. Saturn is a gas) Tj
T*
(giant with no solid surface, and it is so light for its size that it) Tj
T*
(would float in water if you could find a big enough bathtub.) Tj
T*
